    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Opa, existe um projeto  chamado adehabitat (<a href=\"http://r-forge.r-project.org/projects/adehabitat/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://r-forge.r-project.org/projects/adehabitat/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244086243000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2wyOgFxujb9HFI_xyUg5UF\">http://r-forge.r-project.org/projects/adehabitat/</a>) que trata de dados em ecologia espacial.<div>Tem o ade4 também (<a href=\"http://pbil.univ-lyon1.fr/ade4/home.php?lang=eng\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://pbil.univ-lyon1.fr/ade4/home.php?lang%3Deng&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244086243000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1RZSYwCU9CZxU5-qeF6WZ5\">http://pbil.univ-lyon1.fr/ade4/home.php?lang=eng</a>), o adehabitat depende dele, de funções dele, inclusive.</div>\r\n<div><br></div><div>Mais especificamente, o adhabitatlt (<a href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/adehabitatLT/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/adehabitatLT/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244086243000&amp;usg=AOvVaw34bs8QCflI7rhPXCuJ3Svn\">http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/adehabitatLT/index.html</a>) trata de movimento animal.</div>\r\n<div><br></div><div>A função &quot;fpt&quot; num resolve seu problema? Do pacote adhabitatlt.</div><div><br></div><div>Espero ter ajudado :)</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
